  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trachoma elimination and comprehensive eye care project in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Consolidation of Trachoma Elimination, Cataract Services and Comprehensive Eye Care in Gamo Gofa, Derashe, Konso and Alle Zones of SNNPR and expanding to six woredas in Dawuro Zone, SNNPR, Ethiopia&#x2018; project, implemented with Orbis Ethiopia, aims to eliminate the threat of avoidable blindness, restore sight where possible, and build a legacy of quality eye care that will ensure no one goes needlessly blind in the future.</narrative>
  </description>
